description: Repo-wide constraints for the invoice intake take-home
alwaysApply: true
---

# Project

- npm per folder. No pnpm, no npm workspaces, no hoisted root `node_modules`.
- Consume shared code with `"@invo/shared": "file:../../packages/shared"`.
- Sample invoices and the brief live in `static/take-home/`. Do not copy or “clean” them.
- Do not change `apps/accounting-api` behaviour. Copy is verbatim from TAKE_HOME.
- Extract with Gemini; verify amounts, dates, tax, partners, and duplicates in TypeScript.
- Never POST an invoice unless the operator explicitly approves (UI or CLI). `--auto-post` is demo-only.
- If printed totals disagree with recalculated totals, hold for review. Do not fudge numbers to pass 422.
- Never commit `.env`, keys, or `node_modules`.
- Keep slices small: one concern per commit, then push. No dump PRs.
